            "testimonial_2_quality_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_2_communication_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_2_text": "I worked with this development team to build the Coffee Concierge Co. website, and I couldn’t be happier with the results. They were fast, communicative, and truly understood the vision behind the brand. Every detail from the customer experience to the backend setup was thoughtfully handled with care and expertise.\nWhat stood out the most was their willingness to go above and beyond. They offered suggestions I wouldn’t have thought of, anticipated issues before they happened, and made the entire process feel effortless on my end. \nIf you’re looking for a skilled and reliable team who actually cares about your project, look no further. I would absolutely work with them again!",
