            "testimonial_4_service": "Service reviewed: Store build or redesign",
            "testimonial_5_image_type": "profile",
            "testimonial_5_name": "Edison Flores",
            "testimonial_5_role": "Grace and Comfort",
            "testimonial_5_date": "",
            "testimonial_5_quality_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_5_communication_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_5_text": "I had an outstanding experience working with Rootsyntax on the development of our Grace & Comfort Mattress Co. website. From the beginning, their team demonstrated a strong understanding of both the technical and strategic aspects of building a high-performing e-commerce platform.\nAudrey and Harrish were exceptional throughout the entire process. They were professional, responsive, and extremely detail-oriented, ensuring every aspect of the site aligned with our brand vision. Their communication was clear and consistent, and they were always willing to make adjustments and provide thoughtful recommendations to improve functionality, performance, and user experience.\nRootsyntax delivered a clean, modern, and visually compelling website that not only reflects our brand identity but is also optimized for performance and conversions. Their expertise in Shopify development, layout optimization, and technical execution gave us complete confidence.\nI highly recommend Rootsyntax, and especially Audrey and Harrish, to any business looking for a reliable, knowledgeable, and professional web development team. They delivered exactly what they promised and played a key role in bringing Grace & Comfort Mattress Co. to life online.\nEdison Flores\nGrace & Comfort Mattress Co.",
            "testimonial_5_service": "Service reviewed: Store build or redesign",
            "testimonial_6_image_type": "profile",
            "testimonial_6_name": "Tetiana",
            "testimonial_6_role": "BARElyREADY",
            "testimonial_6_date": "",
            "testimonial_6_quality_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_6_communication_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_6_text": "Working with Rootsyntax on my website has been an absolute dream. From day one, they understood my vision, my brand’s emotional tone, and the level of detail I needed. They were incredibly patient, fast, communicative, and truly invested in bringing everything to life exactly the way I imagined it.\nThey went above and beyond offering creative solutions, fixing issues I didn’t even know existed, and making the entire process stress-free. My website now looks beautiful, functions perfectly, and feels aligned with my brand in every way.\nIf you need someone reliable, talented, and genuinely dedicated to your project, look no further. I’m so grateful for their work and will absolutely hire them again. Highly, highly recommend!",
            "testimonial_6_service": "Store build or redesign",
            "testimonial_7_image_type": "profile",
            "testimonial_7_name": "Dominick Polizzi",
            "testimonial_7_role": "Steez",
            "testimonial_7_date": "",
            "testimonial_7_quality_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_7_communication_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_7_text": "I worked with RootSyntax to build a Shopify website, and I couldn’t be happier with the experience. They were responsive, quick to address any requests, and handled any issues that came up with efficiency and professionalism. The entire process was smooth, and their support made it easy to get the site up and running exactly how I envisioned. No complaints—highly recommend them for anyone looking for reliable Shopify development!",
            "testimonial_7_service": "Store build or redesign",
            "testimonial_8_image_type": "profile",
            "testimonial_8_name": "Anthony Shelton",
            "testimonial_8_role": "Bloom Essentials",
            "testimonial_8_date": "",
            "testimonial_8_quality_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_8_communication_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_8_text": "I had an amazing experience working with RootSyntax for my website. Their team was professional, knowledgeable, and incredibly efficient in helping me get everything set up smoothly. They provided expert guidance on optimizing my site, ensuring seamless functionality, and enhancing the overall user experience. If you’re looking for reliable and skilled web development services, I highly recommend RootSyntax. They truly care about their clients and deliver top-notch results!",
            "testimonial_8_service": "Store build or redesign",
            "testimonial_9_image_type": "profile",
            "testimonial_9_name": "Cecilia Chavez",
            "testimonial_9_role": "CamuComplete™",
            "testimonial_9_date": "",
            "testimonial_9_quality_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_9_communication_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_9_text": "Rootsyntax delivered exceptional professional service from start to finish. Audrey and her team maintained clear and consistent communication throughout the process, going above and beyond to accommodate all my requests. They were punctual for every meeting and demonstrated a genuine commitment to ensuring I was completely satisfied with the final product. Their attention to detail and dedication to excellence made the entire experience seamless and enjoyable. Highly recommended!",
            "testimonial_9_service": "System integration",
            "testimonial_10_image_type": "profile",
            "testimonial_10_name": "Ralph Murr",
            "testimonial_10_role": "Sablés Gourmets",
            "testimonial_10_date": "",
            "testimonial_10_quality_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_10_communication_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_10_text": "I am very happy with the final project, they delivered the design and functionalities I asked for. I kept having requests for changes but they were still very responsive and delivered. \nThanks RootSyntax team!!!",
            "testimonial_10_service": "Store migration",
