            "testimonial_3_company": "GreenLife",
            "testimonial_3_text": "Rootsyntax delivered exceptional professional service from start to finish. They were punctual for every meeting and demonstrated a genuine commitment to ensuring I was completely satisfied with the final product. Their attention to detail and dedication to excellence made the entire experience seamless and enjoyable. Highly recommended!",
            "testimonial_4_enabled": true,
            "testimonial_4_name": "",
            "testimonial_4_position": "",
            "testimonial_4_company": "",
            "testimonial_4_text": "We couldn’t be happier with the incredible work done by our Shopify partner who revamped our website!  Their expertise, creativity, and attention to detail have completely transformed our online store into a modern, user-friendly, and visually stunning platform. From seamless navigation to sleek design elements, every aspect of the site reflects their deep understanding of e-commerce and our brand vision.",
            "testimonial_5_enabled": true,
            "testimonial_5_name": "",
            "testimonial_5_position": "",
            "testimonial_5_company": "",
            "testimonial_5_text": "My experience in putting together a website was zero.  Rootsyntax listened to my needs and delivered.  I love my website!  The instructional videos on how to make changes have been very helpful with a slight challenge on language barrier.",
            "testimonial_6_enabled": true,
            "testimonial_6_name": "",
            "testimonial_6_position": "",
            "testimonial_6_company": "",
            "testimonial_6_text": "I had a wonderful experience working with RootSyntax. They are very professional team with great experience. The communication is great and immediate. Miss Aubrey assisted me throughout the way and accommodated any request of modification I sent to her. They are amazing and had finished my web build and design on time just like they promised. I recommend them 100%.",
            "testimonial_7_enabled": true,
            "testimonial_7_name": "",
            "testimonial_7_position": "",
            "testimonial_7_company": "",
            "testimonial_7_text": "Audrey and her team from RootSyntax provided outstanding service. She was consistent and clear in her communication with us, and she set expectations appropriately. \n\nThe work provided was of excellent quality and exceeded our expectations. We had several back and forth exchanges, and her responses were succinct, helpful and timely.\n\nWe HIGHLY recommend RootSyntax, and we WILL be using them again for future work.",
            "testimonial_8_enabled": true,
            "testimonial_8_name": "",
            "testimonial_8_position": "",
            "testimonial_8_company": "",
            "testimonial_8_text": "RootSyntax Technologies made the dream of my new website a reality.  The communication was excellent.  From my first conversation with Audrey, I felt I was in good hands and no issue was too big or small for their team.  They have suggestions on what would be best for my site and the implementation was timely and seamless.  I look forward to continuing to work with them as my business grows and highly recommend their services to anyone working with Shopify.",
            "testimonial_9_enabled": true,
            "testimonial_9_name": "",
            "testimonial_9_position": "",
            "testimonial_9_company": "",
            "testimonial_9_text": "Good value for the price package. They were good about all the edits a requested and worked in a time fashion. If you have a good vision and some content to use, they will do a nice job for you.",
            "testimonial_10_enabled": false,
            "testimonial_10_name": "",
            "testimonial_10_position": "",
            "testimonial_10_company": "",
            "testimonial_10_text": "RootSyntax Technologies were awesome! Very good work at a very fair price. The communication was great. They provided me with exactly what I asked for and exceeded my expectations.  This was the first time I worked with them, but it won’t be the last! Highly recommend!"
